/*!
\page page_stfttcluster StFttCluster

\brief Strip cluster on one FTT plane/row with charge moments and associated hits/points.

\section fttcluster_overview Overview

StFttCluster groups adjacent sTGC strips above threshold into a 1D cluster.
It stores the total ADC charge (0th moment), charge-weighted centroid (1st moment),
RMS width (2nd moment), and links to contributing raw hits, neighbouring clusters,
and fitted space points.

**Detector**: Forward sTGC Tracker (FTT)  
**Stage**: Raw-hit clustering → strip centroid

\section fttcluster_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StFttCluster
\endcode

Stored in \c StFttCollection via \c StPtrVecFttCluster.

\section fttcluster_members Data Members

| Type | Member | Description |
|------|--------|-------------|
| \c Int_t | \c mId | Event-unique cluster ID |
| \c UChar_t | \c mPlane | Detector plane (0–3) |
| \c UChar_t | \c mQuadrant | Quadrant A–D (0–3) |
| \c UChar_t | \c mRow | Strip row within quadrant |
| \c UChar_t | \c mOrientation | Strip orientation code |
| \c Int_t | \c mNStrips | Number of strips |
| \c Float_t | \c mSumAdc | Total ADC charge (0th moment) |
| \c Float_t | \c mX | Charge-weighted centroid, strip units (1st moment) |
| \c Float_t | \c mSigma | RMS width, strip units (2nd moment) |
| \c StPtrVecFttRawHit | \c mRawHits | Contributing raw hits |
| \c StPtrVecFttCluster | \c mNeighbors | Adjacent clusters |
| \c StPtrVecFttPoint | \c mPoints | Associated space points |
| \c UShort_t | \c mIdTruth, \c mQaTruth | MC truth ID and quality |

\section fttcluster_methods Key Methods

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| \c id() | Cluster ID |
| \c plane(), \c quadrant(), \c row() | Detector coordinates |
| \c orientation() | Strip orientation code |
| \c nStrips() | Number of contributing strips |
| \c sumAdc() | Total ADC charge |
| \c x() | Centroid in strip units |
| \c sigma() | RMS width in strip units |
| \c rawHits(), \c neighbor(), \c points() | Access associated objects |
| \c addRawHit(), \c addNeighbor(), \c addPoint() | Add associations |

\section fttcluster_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
for (const StFttCluster* cl : fttColl->clusters()) {
    UChar_t plane = cl->plane();
    float   sumAdc = cl->sumAdc();
    float   x      = cl->x();     // centroid (strip units)
    float   sigma  = cl->sigma();
    int     nPts   = cl->nPoints();
}
\endcode

\see StFttRawHit, StFttPoint, StFttCollection
*/
